IMPORT prelude
IMPORT daydate
IMPORT `sgta-nouns`

-- INSTRUMENT: Telecommunications (Prescribed Trusts) Regulations 2017 (S 403/2017), made under section 74 of the Act (section 97 now), in operation
-- 19 July 2017.  Text: TA1999-TRUSTS-S403-2017 under
-- subjects/sg/telecommunications-prescribed-trusts-regulations-2017/registers/source-bundle/.
-- It prescribes the class of trusts for the definition of "designated trust" in section 32A(1) of the Act (Part 5A in the 2020 Revised Edition).
-- A date before 19 July 2017 answers NOTHING.

§ `Prescribed Trusts Regulations 2017: the class of trusts`

-- src:TA1999-TRUSTS-S403-2017:27 | 1. These Regulations are the Telecommunications (Prescribed
-- src:TA1999-TRUSTS-S403-2017:28 | Trusts) Regulations 2017 and come into operation on 19 July 2017.
-- src:TA1999-TRUSTS-S403-2017:30 | Prescribed class of trusts
-- src:TA1999-TRUSTS-S403-2017:31 | 2. The class of trusts prescribed for the purposes of the definition
-- src:TA1999-TRUSTS-S403-2017:32 | of “designated trust” in section 32A(1) of the Act is the class of
-- src:TA1999-TRUSTS-S403-2017:33 | trusts that meets all of the following conditions:
-- src:TA1999-TRUSTS-S403-2017:34 | (a) the trust is established wholly or partly in respect of a
-- src:TA1999-TRUSTS-S403-2017:35 | telecommunication system (or any part thereof);
-- src:TA1999-TRUSTS-S403-2017:36 | (b) the telecommunication system mentioned in paragraph (a)
-- src:TA1999-TRUSTS-S403-2017:37 | is operated by a designated telecommunication licensee.
@ref Prescribed Trusts Regs 2017 (src:TA1999-TRUSTS-S403-2017:27-37)
GIVEN d IS A DATE
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`Prescribed Trusts Regs reg 1: the Regulations are in operation on the date (from 19 July 2017)` MEANS
    d AT LEAST (Date 19 7 2017)

GIVEN d IS A DATE
      `the trust is established wholly or partly in respect of a telecommunication system or any part of it` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the telecommunication system is operated by a designated telecommunication licensee` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`Prescribed Trusts Regs reg 2: the trust is in the prescribed class for the definition of "designated trust" in section 32A(1) of the Act` MEANS
    BRANCH IF d LESS THAN (Date 19 7 2017) THEN NOTHING
           OTHERWISE JUST (`the trust is established wholly or partly in respect of a telecommunication system or any part of it` AND `the telecommunication system is operated by a designated telecommunication licensee`)
